{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the code comment is **LANTERN-JUNIPER-8808**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `_HAS_DEFAULT_FACTORY_CLASS`, serves as a sentinel to indicate that a dataclass field should utilize a **default factory** function rather than a static default value. It is a specialized instance whose custom `__repr__` method explicitly returns the string `'<factory>'` to appear clearly in the constructor signatures of generated dataclass methods.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.42847163427578394, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.42847163427578394}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.4274588321517605}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.4112158511947293}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.92435939062344}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -5.228720734007229}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -5.52886492956387}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.428084442503323}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.10092074621426}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.354540893919339}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -10.30307204473721}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.30806643713223}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -10.537266800291409}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.736940452940335}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -10.785253593809475}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.872443268186917}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -10.982157776243557}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.059365341551175}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -11.100881645567288}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -11.12331301916348}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -11.236674377806057}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00013227528411263734, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00013227528411263734}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -9.061114025772394}, {"token": " second", "logprob": -13.097532940567316}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -13.298691464126886}, {"token": " released", "logprob": -13.614424420059503}, {"token": " specific", "logprob": -13.82758398121673}, {"token